From 12acc951802bfee34722d96befc0e3cd80e5ff69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sayzal28 <Sayzal28@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:42:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Show the generated outfit suggestions first in the
 character clothes picker

The setup generator's starting outfit and up to three more suggestions are kept
in the setup draft and listed first in Clothes, captioned "Suggested for <role>".
Only outfits the chosen avatar has are shown; picking one uses the normal
selection. When the avatar lacks the generated starting outfit, it still starts
in the white T-shirt, and the console now says so.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
